      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ダイビング　ちゅうに　みにつける\nさんそ　ほきゅうよう　マスク。\nデボンで　つくられた。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "다이빙할 때 몸에 착용하는\n산소 호흡용 마스크.\n데봉에서 만들어졌다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "潛水時裝備在身上\n用來呼吸氧氣的面罩。\n得文製造。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un masque à oxygène fabriqué par la société\nDevon et utilisé pour la plongée sous-marine.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine von der Devon Corporation hergestellte Maske,\ndie Taucher unter Wasser mit ausreichend\nSauerstoff versorgt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Máscara que surte de oxígeno durante las\ninmersiones en el agua. Producto de Devon S. A.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Maschera di ossigeno prodotta dalla Devon,\nutile durante le immersioni.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A device made by Devon Corporation that provides\noxygen to users during the use of Dive.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ダイビング中に　身につける\n酸素補給用の　マスク。\nデボンで　つくられた。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
